<title>HUNGARY: Blackburn keeps on buying Fotex shares.</title>
<headline>Blackburn keeps on buying Fotex shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panama-registered Blackburn International Inc, the biggest single shareholder in Hungarian retailer Fotex Rt, said on Thursday it was continuing to buy Fotex paper.</p>
<p>On July 15, Blackburn bought 5,000 Fotex shares at 211 forints, Blackburn said in the official bourse gazette on Thursday.</p>
<p>Blackburn has announced several purchases this month of Fotex shares in amounts between 5,000 and 27,000 units.</p>
<p>On Thursday Fotex shares continued their rally and at 1008 GMT traded at 253 forints, up eight. Earlier in the session Fotex jumped to 255 forints, its highest level since early 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
